vars: { inkline: { diagram: sequence; design_system: carbon } }

user: User {class: actor}
app: Mobile app
gw: API gateway
svc: Order service

user -> app: Place order
app -> gw: POST /orders
gw -> svc: create(order)
svc -> gw: 201 Created {class: reply}
gw -> app: order id {class: reply}
svc -> svc: publish OrderCreated {class: async}
